<body>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<div class="faq-inner">
  <div class="faq-label">Legal</div>
  <h1 class="faq-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="faq-sub">Effective date: May 5, 2026</p>

  <div style="padding-top:2rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly: name, email, username, profile photo, bio, and any content you post. We also collect usage data to improve the service.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">How We Use It</h2>
    <p>We use your information to provide and improve the service, communicate with you, process payments, and enforce our terms. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We use Stripe for payments and may use other service providers. Their use of your data is governed by their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your data as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. You may request deletion of your account data by contacting us.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use session cookies to maintain your login state. You can control cookie preferences in your browser.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--fg);">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:appeals@wagesociety.com" style="color:var(--accent);">appeals@wagesociety.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>